197
00:54:28,516 --> 00:54:31,516
悪夢の中から 逃げられるのに
Even though I could escape from this nightmare,

198
00:54:31,516 --> 00:54:34,316
まだ掴んでる
I'm still holding on.

199
00:54:34,316 --> 00:54:38,516
欲望が蠢いたら
If desire squirms...

200
00:54:42,316 --> 00:54:45,716
私のもの そう 私のもの
It's mine, yes, it's mine!

201
00:54:45,716 --> 00:54:49,316
自分自身を信じ込ませてしまって
Making myself believe in it,

202
00:54:49,316 --> 00:54:52,516
縛り付けたとしても
even if I tie it down...

203
00:54:52,516 --> 00:54:55,516
気づいた
I realized

204
00:54:55,516 --> 00:54:57,516
呪いの出口
the exit from the curse.

205
00:54:57,516 --> 00:54:59,516
永遠の夜の中へ
Into the eternal night...

206
00:54:59,516 --> 00:55:00,516
目を覚まして あなたの悪から
Wake up from your evil!

207
00:55:01,373 --> 00:55:05,573
連れ出す舟よ
Oh boat that carries me away,

208
00:55:05,573 --> 00:55:09,373
出港して
set sail.

209
00:55:09,673 --> 00:55:12,573
私のものではない 私のもの
It isn't mine, yet it's mine.

210
00:55:12,573 --> 00:55:16,573
漆黒の薔薇 朽ち果てたとしても
Even if the pitch-black rose decays,

211
00:55:16,573 --> 00:55:21,873
枯れない魂 今では
a soul that never wilts, even now...

212
00:55:21,873 --> 00:55:24,873
魔の誘惑 永遠の美貌
Demonic temptation, eternal beauty—

213
00:55:24,873 --> 00:55:28,573
そんな幻 追っていたのでしょう
I must have been chasing such illusions.

214
00:55:28,573 --> 00:55:33,373
手放せ 偽りついたかい
Let go, were you bound by falsehoods?

215
00:55:33,373 --> 00:55:39,373
さあ行こう 夜明けに顔向けて
Come, let us go, facing toward the dawn!

216
00:55:42,373 --> 00:55:45,573
曰くを宿した舟
A ship laden with legend,

217
00:55:45,573 --> 00:55:50,373
希望だけ乗せて行く 神は乗らない
carrying only hope forward, with no gods aboard.

218
00:55:50,373 --> 00:55:57,873
さあ...
Come...

219
00:56:17,573 --> 00:56:23,173
風に吹かれて 誰にも気づかれぬよう
Blown by the wind, so no one will notice me,

220
00:56:23,173 --> 00:56:29,173
区別がつかない モノクロの世界
in an indistinct, monochrome world.

221
00:56:29,173 --> 00:56:35,173
色を足しても 何も見えなくて
Even if I add color, I can't see anything,

222
00:56:35,173 --> 00:56:42,873
まるで私は 息を止めていた
as if I'd been holding my breath all along.

223
00:56:45,573 --> 00:56:51,373
もういいよ 遠くても 叶えたい
It's okay now; even if it's far, I want to fulfill it.

224
00:56:51,373 --> 00:56:54,173
私は 孤高の世界
My solitary world,

225
00:56:54,173 --> 00:56:58,573
迷いも 抱きしめていたいのに
even though I want to embrace my doubts...

226
00:56:58,573 --> 00:57:04,173
夢のキャンバスに 描き続ける意味は
The meaning of continuing to paint on the canvas of dreams

227
00:57:04,173 --> 00:57:12,873
この胸に 輝いている Story
is the story shining within my heart.

228
00:57:22,373 --> 00:57:27,873
流れることに 意味などないけれど
There's no meaning in simply drifting along,

229
00:57:27,873 --> 00:57:31,173
拾い集めた
yet the fragments I collected,

230
00:57:31,173 --> 00:57:34,373
欠片失うの
am I losing them?

231
00:57:34,373 --> 00:57:40,373
そして夜は その冷たさを 溶かして
And so, the night melts that coldness,

232
00:57:40,373 --> 00:57:44,373
手を伸ばした
and I reached out my hand.

233
00:57:44,573 --> 00:57:49,573
もういいよ 遠くても 届けたい
It's okay now; even if it's far, I want to reach you.

234
00:57:49,573 --> 00:57:51,573
私は
I want to...

235
00:57:51,573 --> 00:57:57,173
ぬくもり抱く 涙も 抱きしめていたいのに
embrace warmth and even hold my tears tight, yet...

236
00:57:57,173 --> 00:58:02,873
夢のキャンバスに 心込めるのは
Pouring my heart onto the canvas of dreams

237
00:58:02,873 --> 00:58:11,873
この空に 描き出していく Story
is the story I paint across this sky.

238
00:58:21,373 --> 00:58:26,873
そして夜は その冷たさを
And so, the night melts that coldness,

239
00:58:26,873 --> 00:58:31,373
溶かして 手を伸ばして
as I reach out my hand.

240
00:58:31,573 --> 00:58:36,373
もういいの 遠くても 叶えたい
It's fine now; even if it's far, I want to fulfill it.

241
00:58:36,373 --> 00:58:38,873
私の 孤高の世界
My solitary world,

242
00:58:38,873 --> 00:58:43,873
迷いも 言葉で包んだ
wrapping even my hesitation in words.

243
00:58:43,873 --> 00:58:49,173
夢のキャンバスに 色を足していく
Adding colors to the canvas of dreams,

244
00:58:49,173 --> 00:58:56,373
この胸に 今輝いて
now shining within my heart.

245
00:58:56,373 --> 00:59:02,173
強くなくてもいい 壊れかけてもいい
It's okay not to be strong, it's okay if I'm falling apart,

246
00:59:02,173 --> 00:59:07,873
この心は 遠くに羽ばたいて
this heart flutters wings into the distance.

247
00:59:07,873 --> 00:59:13,373
響くように 塗り替えていく
So it resonates, I will repaint...

248
00:59:13,373 --> 00:59:19,373
パレット
...the palette.

249
00:59:43,873 --> 00:59:49,873
Hello everyone!

250
00:59:50,373 --> 00:59:55,373
It is Day 2 of 5th Fes!

251
00:59:58,373 --> 01:00:04,873
Yes, yes, welcome to Day 2 of hololive 5th Fes Capture the Moment stage 1 concert!

252
01:00:04,896 --> 01:00:07,696
Are you guys enjoying the show so far?

253
01:00:08,696 --> 01:00:10,396
Yay!

254
01:00:12,596 --> 01:00:18,396
You know, I was really... I want to talk about "Violet" first, because...

255
01:00:18,796 --> 01:00:24,296
Yesterday, I heard you guys sing along to the instrumental,

256
01:00:24,796 --> 01:00:29,496
and I was like, ah, uh, I feel bad for not being on Day 1,

257
01:00:29,496 --> 01:00:36,796
but you know, I knew I was opening for, you know, Day 2, so I couldn't have thought of a better song to open than "Violet", so...

258
01:00:36,796 --> 01:00:40,396
Hope you guys had fun singing it! Thank you again!

259
01:00:42,896 --> 01:00:47,396
And of course, I sang two of my senpais' songs:

260
01:00:47,896 --> 01:00:53,396
Sencho's "Dead Man's Chest" and Towa Senpai's "Palette".

261
01:00:55,696 --> 01:01:02,896
I specifically wanted to choose their songs because...

262
01:01:03,096 --> 01:01:07,696
...they're senpais that I really look up to, and...

263
01:01:07,896 --> 01:01:15,396
I always feel like my journey here wouldn't have been possible if I didn't discover my senpais many, many years ago.

264
01:01:16,996 --> 01:01:23,396
And I always wanted to pay respect to the path they paved for us, so yeah, I hope you guys enjoyed it!

265
01:01:25,896 --> 01:01:28,096
I'm so nervous again!

266
01:01:29,896 --> 01:01:43,696
Yeah, and you know, I of course didn't really tell you guys specifically what penlight colors to use, but I knew you guys would get my message cause we share a brain cell, right? Right?

267
01:01:47,396 --> 01:01:56,396
Yeah, so, well, now going by the different setlist, cause we have different setlists for Day 1 and Day 2...

268
01:01:56,396 --> 01:02:05,696
So, going by the process of elimination, we have a couple of songs from my new EP... Actually, who here bought my EP?

269
01:02:07,396 --> 01:02:11,396
Yay! Thank you so much! I hope you were lucky to get an autograph.

270
01:02:11,396 --> 01:02:18,896
I tried to sign as much as possible, but I knew, you know, sometimes you can't be lucky.

271
01:02:19,396 --> 01:02:27,396
Thank you, thank you! But yeah, I want you guys to have even more fun than before today. I mean, you always have fun, so that's good, but...

272
01:02:28,396 --> 01:02:34,696
Yeah! Now, you know, sing along, have fun,

273
01:02:34,696 --> 01:02:42,096
and I always think that a live stage is where not only me performing is creating the performance,

274
01:02:42,096 --> 01:02:47,396
but you guys as well! You really help, you know, help everyone with that special experience.

275
01:02:47,896 --> 01:02:52,696
So let's create an unforgettable memory together today, okay?

276
01:02:55,896 --> 01:02:57,896
Yay!

277
01:02:58,096 --> 01:03:07,896
Anyways, I would also like to shout out to those watching at home and at the live viewings in the theater! Hello! Hello to you again!

278
01:03:07,896 --> 01:03:20,396
And also, the lovely, lovely girls doing a watch-along right now! Hi, guys! Thank you ID, EN, and everyone else doing a watch-along! Thank you, thank you!

279
01:03:21,096 --> 01:03:26,696
You know, I'm always amazed by everyone's support,

280
01:03:26,696 --> 01:03:38,096
and really, without the support of HoloEN members as well, I wouldn't have had the confidence to stand here today.

281
01:03:38,096 --> 01:03:40,896
Thank you! I love you!

282
01:03:43,096 --> 01:03:53,696
And of course, I would like to remind you guys about the hashtag for today's concert as well, #TakoTori1stConcert, as usual.

283
01:03:53,696 --> 01:03:57,896
Post your thoughts about it, post the screenshots—no videos, no videos!

284
01:03:58,396 --> 01:04:10,096
Post screenshots and, you know, Kiwawa and I, whenever we have time, we've been checking the hashtag. And of course, after as well, I want to hear what you guys thought about the live, so, yeah!

285
01:04:10,396 --> 01:04:12,896
Thank you, thank you!

286
01:04:13,696 --> 01:04:28,896
And unlike yesterday, first MC means I unfortunately have to bid farewell to those watching the sneak peek on YouTube. I'm sorry.

287
01:04:29,396 --> 01:04:39,396
But if you want to keep the party going, head to the streaming site via the description or comment—I don't know where the comment is.

288
01:04:40,396 --> 01:04:50,896
Yeah! But I know that some of you guys won't get a chance to see my new outfit that I revealed yesterday. So I thought, maybe...

289
01:04:52,896 --> 01:05:01,896
Maybe you guys can help me transition into the new costume here, so that even those of you...

290
01:05:02,776 --> 01:05:04,076
So, on YouTube...

291
01:05:04,076 --> 01:05:05,576
chiramise can see.

292
01:05:05,976 --> 01:05:06,976
All right, so I'm gonna count down from 3.

293
01:05:06,976 --> 01:05:08,876
Count down with me, okay?

294
01:05:08,876 --> 01:05:11,876
And I will switch into the new outfit for you guys to see.

295
01:05:12,576 --> 01:05:13,576
Ready?

296
01:05:15,076 --> 01:05:17,376
Ready? Give me a 1 if you're ready!

297
01:05:18,876 --> 01:05:20,276
All right, all right, all right.

298
01:05:20,576 --> 01:05:21,776
All right, here we go.

299
01:05:21,776 --> 01:05:25,976
3, 2, 1, ha!

300
01:05:28,876 --> 01:05:30,776
Tada!

301
01:05:31,776 --> 01:05:33,576
Thank you, thank you, thank you!

302
01:05:37,276 --> 01:05:39,776
All right, it's time to move on to the next song.

303
01:05:40,076 --> 01:05:44,276
And I think this song also fits the starry stage perfectly.

304
01:05:44,576 --> 01:05:45,976
No, not that one yet, but...

305
01:05:46,976 --> 01:05:50,076
But this one is from one of my favorite franchises.

306
01:05:50,076 --> 01:05:51,776
So I hope you guys listen.

307
01:05:51,776 --> 01:05:54,576
Anyways, the song will fit the starry stage perfectly.

308
01:05:54,776 --> 01:05:56,776
Please give it a listen.

309
01:06:03,776 --> 01:10:01,476
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The sneak peek part of the show has ended. Thank you for watching.

310
01:10:01,452 --> 01:12:54,452
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The sneak peek part of the show has ended.
Thank you for watching!

